# 7. Why Port Scanning Matters

Port scanning helps identify:

- Exposed services
- Unexpected services
- Attack surface
- Network configuration problems

Example:

```text
22   → SSH
80   → HTTP
443  → HTTPS
3389 → RDP
```

Port numbers alone do not prove which service is actually running.

