# 17. Example Python Menu

```python
def show_menu():
    print("""
================================
 CYBERSECURITY ASSESSMENT TOOL
================================

1. Port Scan
2. File Hash
3. Log Analysis
4. Exit
""")

while True:
    show_menu()

    choice = input("Select: ")

    if choice == "1":
        print("Starting authorized port scan...")
    elif choice == "2":
        print("Starting file hash...")
    elif choice == "3":
        print("Starting log analysis...")
    elif choice == "4":
        print("Exiting.")
        break
    else:
        print("Invalid selection.")
```

